 # ComfyUI-Ollama-Describer
+
+## Secure Nodes V2 conversion
+
+This sibling is the capability-scoped Secure Nodes V2 implementation. Ollama
+requests use the host's loopback service or an administrator-configured
+`ollama://` profile; the pack receives no socket, raw image buffer, filesystem
+path, or credential. Directory captioning reads only managed input assets and
+writes captions beneath managed output. Models must already be installed by
+the administrator: the V1 automatic Ollama pull is intentionally not retained.
+
+The local-file tool and arbitrary-Python tool are security-rejected because
+their intended behaviors grant model-selected ambient filesystem access and
+arbitrary code/import execution. All other node behaviors are supported; the
+complete disposition and authority ledger is in `SECURE_CONVERSION.md`.
 
